# Process Checklist

## Plan 1: Core Full-Stack & Use Case Points (UCP) Model
- [ ] **1.1 Backend Setup & Endpoints**
  - [ ] Initialize FastAPI application and configure CORS.
  - [ ] Create basic POST `/api/v1/estimate` and POST `/api/v1/calibrate` endpoints.
  - [ ] Set up lightweight SQLite database for calibration logs.
- [ ] **1.2 Backend UCP Engine**
  - [ ] Implement XML/JSON parser for `<Actor>` and `<UseCase>` tags.
  - [ ] Implement UCP math logic (UAW, UUCW, TCF, ECF, total cost).
  - [ ] Integrate parser and math logic into `/api/v1/estimate`.
- [ ] **1.3 Frontend Setup & Architecture**
  - [ ] Scaffold React SPA with TypeScript.
  - [ ] Define semantic CSS tokens (Strictly Vanilla CSS, no Tailwind).
  - [ ] Set up feature-based directory structure.
- [ ] **1.4 Frontend UI Components (UCP)**
  - [ ] Build drag-and-drop file upload zone.
  - [ ] Build input forms for Hourly Rate, TCF, and ECF.
  - [ ] Build Summary Card and Breakdown Table components.
  - [ ] Implement Loading, Error, Empty, and Success states.
- [ ] **1.5 Frontend to Backend Integration**
  - [ ] Implement API service to post data to `/api/v1/estimate`.

## Plan 2: Class Diagram (Graph Weight) Model Integration
- [ ] **2.1 Backend Graph Weight Engine**
  - [ ] Implement XML/JSON parser for Class Diagrams (`<Class>` tags, Attributes, Methods, Relationships).
  - [ ] Implement Graph Weight math logic.
- [ ] **2.2 Backend Auto-Routing**
  - [ ] Update `/api/v1/estimate` to automatically route between UCP and Graph Weight tools based on file contents.
- [ ] **2.3 Frontend Dynamic Results**
  - [ ] Update Breakdown Table to conditionally render Class Diagram metrics.
- [ ] **2.4 Frontend Calibration Activity**
  - [ ] Add "Log Actual Time" button in Results State.
  - [ ] Integrate button with POST `/api/v1/calibrate` endpoint.
